# `system-config` on hickory-resolver resolves the host's nameservers, and
# mail-auth imports that entry point unconditionally. The backing crate is
# platform-specific: Apple reads SystemConfiguration, everything else parses
# /etc/resolv.conf. Both are declared so `buck2 build //...` is green on the
# Linux smoke runner and on a macOS workstation.

